{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In person, the holder shows a QR code and the reader scans it: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code carries the holder’s ephemeral key and how to reach it over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Bluetooth LE. The two devices then exchange encrypted messages over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GATT. The package carries the Bluetooth side itself: your app shows or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scans the QR code, follows the session’s states, and asks the holder."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Engagement is by QR code only. NFC engagement (a tap instead of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code) is in OID4VCgo’s Kotlin library, not this package: an iOS holder"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t answer a reader’s tap, and an iOS reader can’t tap a holder. An"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Android reader or holder that offers both still works with this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"package over the QR code."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Both sides need "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription"},{"type":"text","text":" in the app’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Info.plist. Keep the app in the foreground during a session: neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"side keeps one going while the app is suspended. A session answers one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request. Bluetooth failures are "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError","isActive":true},{"text":"s; protocol failures","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"are "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError"},{"text":"s.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Share-as-the-holder","type":"heading","text":"Share as the holder","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startProximityPresentation(timeouts:modes:)"},{"type":"text","text":" returns a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" whose "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/qrCode"},{"type":"text","text":" you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"show. It offers both "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityBLEMode"},{"type":"text","text":"s by default: it advertises"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for the reader and scans for it at once, until a reader connects"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either way (a reader offered both should connect in central client"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode). Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"modes"},{"type":"text","text":" to offer one. It then reports"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/State-swift.enum\/requestReceived(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with who is asking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and what: ask the holder, then respond or decline."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ What the holder agreed to share: a requested document, the held","\/\/\/ mdoc to answer it with, and the elements to disclose.","struct InPersonAnswer {","    let document: Int","    let credentialID: String","    let elements: [MdocPresentation.Element]","}","","\/\/\/ Shares an mdoc in person. `showQRCode` displays the code; `consent`","\/\/\/ shows the reader's request and returns the holder's answer, or nil","\/\/\/ to decline. Returns whether the copy shared had been seen by another","\/\/\/ Verifier, or nil when nothing was shared.","func shareInPerson(wallet: Wallet, showQRCode: (String) -> Void,","                   consent: (ProximityPresentation.Request) async -> InPersonAnswer?) async throws -> Bool? {","    let session = try wallet.startProximityPresentation()","    showQRCode(session.qrCode)","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .requestReceived(let request):","            guard let answer = await consent(request) else {","                await session.decline()","                return nil","            }","            \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks.","            return try await session.respond(document: answer.document, credentialID: answer.credentialID,","                                             elements: answer.elements)","        case .failed(let error):","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Show "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/Request\/reader"},{"type":"text","text":" on the consent screen. A"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader that signs its request (reader authentication) is named, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity\/Status-swift.enum\/trusted"},{"type":"text","text":" when its certificate chains"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/mdocReaderRoots"},{"type":"text","text":". An unsigned request could"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"come from anyone who scanned the code. As over the Digital Credentials"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"API, "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader"},{"type":"text","text":" ends a session"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from any other reader before the holder sees it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/cancel()"},{"type":"text","text":" ends a session at any point, as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"holder leaves the screen, say. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts"},{"type":"text","text":" sets how long it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"waits: by default 60 seconds for a reader to connect, 30 for its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request, and 300 for the holder to decide."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Read-as-the-verifier","text":"Read as the verifier","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader"},{"type":"text","text":" needs no "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},{"type":"text","text":": give it the IACAs whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mdocs it accepts, and, to sign its requests so holders see who is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"asking, a key in a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" and its certificate chain, with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader authentication extended key usage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderConfiguration"},{"type":"text","text":"). The reader is a production one: it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalidInput"},{"type":"text","text":") a configuration that leaves a decision open:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which IACAs issue which document types ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"anyIssuerForAnyType"},{"type":"text","text":", or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerRootsByDocType"},{"type":"text","text":"), each role’s revocation ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"revocation"},{"type":"text","text":" with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"crls"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"noRevocationCheck"},{"type":"text","text":" to decline), and whether a document’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"revocation status is checked ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"statusCheck"},{"type":"text","text":"). "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"development"},{"type":"text","text":" relaxes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this, for trying out a development issuer’s documents; never ship an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app with it set. "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReader\/start(qrCode:docType:elements:timeouts:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes the holder’s QR code and what to ask for."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/\/ Reads an mDL's name and portrait from the holder whose QR code was","\/\/\/ scanned. Returns the verified mdoc, its status checked, or nil if the","\/\/\/ holder declined.","func readInPerson(qrCode: String, issuerRoots: String, crls: String) async throws -> VerifiedMdoc? {","    let reader = try ProximityReader(configuration: ProximityReaderConfiguration(","        issuerRoots: issuerRoots, crls: crls, revocation: [.issuer, .status],","        anyIssuerForAnyType: true, statusCheck: .check))","    let session = try reader.start(qrCode: qrCode, docType: \"org.iso.18013.5.1.mDL\",","                                   elements: [\"org.iso.18013.5.1\": [\"given_name\", \"family_name\", \"portrait\"]])","    for await state in session.states {","        switch state {","        case .verified(let mdoc):","            \/\/ Its status was checked first: valid, or it names none.","            return mdoc","        case .failed(let error):","            \/\/ A revoked or suspended document is WalletError","            \/\/ .documentNotValid.","            throw error","        case let state where state.isFinal:","            return nil","        default:","            continue","        }","    }","    return nil","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" carries the disclosed elements, the document signer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the IACA it chains to, and its validity. Decide which issuers to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accept on "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuerChain"},{"type":"text","text":", the verified certificate path:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/issuer"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/trustAnchor"},{"type":"text","text":" are names any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"document signer under a trusted IACA can choose, for display."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"statusCheck: .check"},{"type":"text","text":", the session checks the document’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"revocation status before it’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".verified"},{"type":"text","text":", as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderSession\/checkStatus()"},{"type":"text","text":" does: it closes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connection, fetches the issuer’s status list over the network, so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader needs a connection then, and verifies the list is signed under"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the certificate the document names or the CA that signed the document"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signer (ISO\/IEC 18013-5 §12.3.6). Only a document that’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/valid"},{"type":"text","text":", or names no status ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocStatus\/noStatus"},{"type":"text","text":"), is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".verified"},{"type":"text","text":", with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/VerifiedMdoc\/status"},{"type":"text","text":" set; any other status fails"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the session with "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".documentNotValid"},{"type":"text","text":", its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"protocolError"},{"type":"text","text":" the status. With "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".decline"},{"type":"text","text":", nothing checks it:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for a reader where something else stands in, which then calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderSession\/checkStatus()"},{"type":"text","text":" itself or checks otherwise."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Presenting-in-person","title":"Presenting in person","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityTimeouts","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityError"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentinginperson"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Presenting in person"},"references":{"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityPresentation/Request/reader":{"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reader","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet23ProximityReaderIdentityV","text":"ProximityReaderIdentity","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"reader","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/Request\/reader","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Who sent the request."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximitypresentation\/request\/reader","type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"abstract":[{"text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credential store and Wallet Provider.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"Wallet","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Wallet","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/requireTrustedMdocReader":{"abstract":[{"text":"Refuses an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"org-iso-mdoc"},{"text":" request no recognized reader signed:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"startMdocPresentation"},{"text":" throws ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"untrustedVerifier"},{"text":", and nothing is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shown to the holder. Needs ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mdocReaderRoots"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/requiretrustedmdocreader","type":"topic","title":"requireTrustedMdocReader","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requireTrustedMdocReader","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/requireTrustedMdocReader"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet/startProximityPresentation(timeouts:modes:)":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startProximityPresentation","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"timeouts","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet17ProximityTimeoutsV","text":"ProximityTimeouts","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"modes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16ProximityBLEModeO","text":"ProximityBLEMode","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet21ProximityPresentationC","text":"ProximityPresentation","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startProximityPresentation(timeouts:modes:)","title":"startProximityPresentation(timeouts:modes:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet\/startproximitypresentation(timeouts:modes:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Starts an ISO\/IEC 18013-5 in-person presentation over BLE: show"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"qrCode"},{"type":"text","text":". In "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"modes"},{"type":"text","text":", both by default, it advertises for a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reader (peripheral server mode) and scans for one (central client"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mode) until a reader connects either way; a reader offered both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should choose central client mode. Bluetooth failures end it as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".failed"},{"type":"text","text":" with a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProximityError"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletError":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WalletError","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walleterror","abstract":[{"text":"An error from OID4VCgo: a stable ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code"},{"text":", the issuer’s, Authorization","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Server’s or Verifier’s own error code when it gave one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"protocolError"},{"text":"), and a message for logs: it never carries personal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"data, a remote party’s own description, a URL’s path or query, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"control characters. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"localizedDescription"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a sentence fit to show the holder; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isRetryable"},{"text":" says whether trying","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same step again may succeed.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WalletError","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"WalletError"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityReaderIdentity":{"abstract":[{"text":"Who sent a request, as the holder sees it.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"ProximityReaderIdentity","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximityreaderidentity","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ProximityReaderIdentity","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ProximityReaderIdentity","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityReaderIdentity"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet","role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet","abstract":[{"text":"Receive verifiable credentials and present them from an iOS app: over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP under HAIP, to Safari’s Digital Credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"API, and in person over Bluetooth.","type":"text"}],"title":"OID4VCWallet"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityReaderSession/checkStatus()":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"checkStatus","kind":"identifier